#: ../../index.rst:3
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "Kom godt i gang"

#: ../../index.rst:6
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Introduktion"

#: ../../index.rst:8
msgid ""
"Welcome to the |prodname| Windows Client User Guide. This guide describes"
" client functionality for users in |prodname|."
msgstr "Velkommen til |prodname| Windows-klient Brugervejledning. Denne vejledning beskriver klientfunktionalitet for brugere i |prodname|."

#: ../../index.rst:11
msgid "Client Agents"
msgstr "Klientagenter"

#: ../../index.rst:13
msgid ""
"|prodname| client agents are available for Windows, Mac, iOS, Android, "
"and Windows phones. These clients are designed to work with your "
"|prodname| account which can be powered by any supported storage service."
msgstr "|prodname| klientagenter er tilgængelige for Windows, Mac, iOS, Android og Windows-telefoner. Disse klienter er designet til at arbejde med din |prodname| konto, som kan drives af enhver understøttet lagringstjeneste."

#: ../../index.rst:16
msgid "Windows Client Agent"
msgstr "Windows-klientagent"

#: ../../index.rst:19
msgid "System Requirement"
msgstr "Systemkrav"

#: ../../index.rst:21
msgid "OS - Windows XP, Vista, 7/8/8.1/10"
msgstr "OS - Windows XP, Vista, 7/8/8.1/10"

#: ../../index.rst:22
msgid ""
"Normally on Windows Server type machine such as 2025/2022/2019, use "
"server agent instead of client agent. However, the client agent can run "
"as desktop application on Windows Server OS as well.  For example, if you"
" plan to have the desktop agent run in a terminal server environment, you"
" need to install desktop agent instead of server agent."
msgstr "Normalt på en Windows Server type maskine såsom 2025/2022/2019, brug server agent i stedet for klient agent. Dog kan klient agenten også køre som skrivebordsapplikation på Windows Server OS. For eksempel, hvis du planlægger at have skrivebordsagenten kørende i et terminal server miljø, skal du installere skrivebordsagenten i stedet for server agenten."

#: ../../index.rst:24
msgid "Hard Drive - 100MB"
msgstr "Harddisk - 100MB"

#: ../../index.rst:24
msgid "50MB for the installed program"
msgstr "50MB for det installerede program"

#: ../../index.rst:25
msgid "at least 50MB for the operation of cache folder"
msgstr "mindst 50MB til driften af cache-mappen"

#: ../../index.rst:26
msgid "CPU - No specific requirement (Intel/AMD x86/x64)"
msgstr "CPU - Ingen specifikke krav (Intel/AMD x86/x64)"

#: ../../index.rst:27
msgid "Internet Connection"
msgstr "Internetforbindelse"

#: ../../index.rst:31
msgid "This guide is written against Windows Client agent version |release|"
msgstr "Denne vejledning er skrevet til Windows Client agent version |release|"

